title: The palette's two diff commands only turn the diff on and off: side by side and 7 lines around are chosen while it is off, then "Show What Changed Inside the Files" must show it side by side with 7 lines around, and "Show the Files as They Are" must keep both (the log says how it is shown each time)
folders: git-changes
expect-log: what changed inside the files: shown, 2 sides, 7 lines kept around a change
expect-log: what changed is shown inside 1 files
forbid-log: what changed inside the files: .*1 sides
forbid-log: what changed inside the files: shown, 2 sides, 3 lines
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 800
zoom 0.5
diff split
diff around 7
wait 500
palette Show What Changed Inside
wait 800
mark 1-palette
wait 500
ui click 860 110
wait 1500
mark 2-on-side-by-side
wait 500
palette Show the Files as They Are
wait 800
ui click 860 110
wait 1200
mark 3-off
wait 500
diff on
wait 1200
mark 4-on-again
wait 500
quit
